$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Reference case: basin_da
$ Depth-averaged (one layer) non-hydrostatic basin, 600 m x 600 m at 2 m,
$ regular waves from the west shoaling on a 1:50 beach.  Exercises the
$ SwashExpDep2DHflow path and the 5-point SIP pressure solver.
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROJECT 'basin' '01'
    'GPU regression: depth-averaged basin'
    'explicit scheme, SIP solver'
    'generated by tests/cases/gen_inputs.py'
$
SET LEVEL 0. DEPMIN 0.001 MAXERR 3 SEED 12345 CARTESIAN
MODE DYNAMIC TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN
$
CGRID REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 600. 600. 300 300
$
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 300 300 2. 2.
READINP BOTTOM 1. 'bot.dat' 3 0 FREE
$
INITIAL ZERO
$
BOUNDCOND SIDE W CCW BTYPE WEAKREFL SMOOTHING 10 SEC CON REGULAR 0.5 8.0 0.
SPONGELAYER E 60.
$
NONHYDROSTATIC BOX 1.0
BREAKING 0.6 0.3
FRICTION MANNING 0.019
TIMEI METHOD EXPLICIT 0.4 0.8
$
POINTS 'GAUGES' 100. 300. 300. 300. 450. 300. 550. 300. 300. 100.
TABLE 'GAUGES' NOHEAD 'gauges.tbl' TSEC WATL OUTPUT 000000.000 0.05 SEC
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD 'fields.mat' LAY 3 BOTL WATL VEL OUTPUT 000000.000 1.0 SEC
$
TEST 1 0
COMPUTE 000000.000 0.05 SEC 000200.000
STOP
